                    "type": "bold"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Bright 650 sq ft unit on a quiet, tree-lined street. 12-month lease. Water and trash included; electricity and internet paid by tenant. Shared laundry room in the basement. One parking spot available for $75/mo. Cats OK, no dogs. Security deposit equal to one month's rent. Application fee $40. Walkable neighborhood, 5 min to the bus stop. Available July 1. Contact the property manager to schedule a viewing."
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Explique: o que está incluído? quanto custa o estacionamento? posso ter cachorro? quanto é a caução? quando fica disponível?"
          }
        ]
      },
